            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Yes, on most current touchscreen models, through iFIT. You need a paid iFIT Pro membership and your own Netflix account; iFIT says the feature is on select machines with touchscreens of 10 inches or larger. Without iFIT Pro the apps are unavailable, and you cannot install apps of your own.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
